# Build context for deploy/Dockerfile: sources only. Dependencies and build
# output are made inside the image. Settings and secrets are left out at any
# depth: the operator guide puts .env and secrets/ next to a Compose file,
# which may be inside a checkout.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets/
.git
.github
docs
